WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.583
Be fearless.

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:03.208
Change is good.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:08.166
I don't really care
if I sleep too much.

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:09.875
It's kind of fun,

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.375
to see how much 
one can do in a day.

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:16.083
I want to look pretty,
but not too made up.

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:18.333
Not that I ever 
look very made up.

00:00:20.041 --> 00:00:21.625
I was able to turn

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:30.708
I started my company
when I was 50 years old.

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.958
My work is based 
on need and want.

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:36.458
It’s extremely powerful

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:38.500
to take an 
idea, and turn it

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.416
into a 
billion-dollar business.

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:41.958
This is what I 
want to look like.

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:43.416
That is my look.

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:46.708
Hard work 
is essential 

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:47.958
to making an 
idea come to life,

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:49.250
and I love 
hard workers.

00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:51.666
Ah, that is 
such a cake.

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:53.541
If you can 
find somebody

00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:54.583
that's going 
to be as good

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:55.625
or better 
than you,

00:00:55.625 --> 00:00:56.541
embrace them,

00:00:56.541 --> 00:00:57.875
and bring them in.

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:58.500
That's the one I took.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.125
How much THC

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.750
was in that 
one I got?

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.708
1 milligram.

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:03.250
Don’t want to 
put you to sleep.

00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:07.583
I try to 
look forward.

00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:11.458
When you’re through 
changing, you’re through.

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:17.875
I’m Martha Stewart,
and this is MasterClass.

